I wake up early every morning.
Today also I woke up early.
It is still a little dark outside the window.
I go into the kitchen.
I am making coffee.
The coffee is very hot.
The coffee smells very nice.
I take my cup.
I go near the window.
I am looking outside.
The city of Mumbai is waking up now.
The street below is very quiet.
Some people are walking on the street.
A milkman is going by on a bicycle.
Birds are singing in the trees.
I am slowly drinking my hot coffee.
I like this time of the morning very much.
The morning air is nice and cool.
My day is starting now.
